As the **Specialized Worker in AI Orchestration and Logic Design**, I have developed the core initiation logic for the Project Management MCP Server. This implementation focuses on the **Discovery Pattern**, ensuring that every project begins with a rigorous assessment of scope, complexity, and stakeholder alignment before any technical execution occurs.

The following implementation includes the `/project-kickoff` prompt (the agentic workflow) and the `create_project` tool (the functional execution), incorporating weighted complexity scoring and automated budget estimation.

